{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道自己舍不得什么，却还是累得提不起劲，没法立刻重新振作。\",\n      \"key\": \"提不起劲\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"text\": \"那一步曾让他重新动起来，那种生活也确实安慰过他，他两样都舍不得。\",\n      \"key\": \"重新动起来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕再往前又把自己逼得太狠。\",\n      \"key\": \"逼得太狠\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他想先歇一歇，却还是放不下那些妨碍那种生活的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"妨碍那种生活\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他还不知道怎么两头都顾上，却没那么急着逼自己舍掉一头了。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍掉一头\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R45\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留知道舍不得什么却仍无法勇敢向前的距离，改成他实际的疲惫和无力，不再用反高潮式总结代替心理状态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R46\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-2\", \"S10-3\", \"S10-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"明确找回两条路都曾真正帮助过他的事实：行动让他重新动起来，旧愿给过他安慰。再分别写出行动可能使他重新陷入硬撑，以及只想回到安宁仍放不下威胁它的事情。没有把两条路简化成抽象的利弊。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R47\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-2\", \"S10-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留继续争取时不能忘记那种生活，也不能因为想歇息就放下威胁它的事情。把两条条件式要求改成他实际同时惦记的两件事，不替他制定行动准则。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R48\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他暂时不知道怎样兼顾的事实，不再重复反复想着愿望这一没有增加心理内容的描述。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R49\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并补足因果\",\n      \"why\": \"保留非此即彼的逼迫开始松动这一实际变化。它现在接在他想歇息却仍惦记着威胁旧愿的事情之后，说明两边已经可以同时留在心里，但还没有解决怎样兼顾的问题。保留原编号，供后段箭头继续使用。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "67b5bb8e-b842-4da9-8c32-1a7034e475c2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T002014185472Z", "elapsed_seconds": 112.547, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:22:06.750884+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "118f2a18fecda4866e93c5fdb9c1500444c98f52b56773c289d249bb03a784be", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.p